  "description": "MUBFUN crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C90 H115 N10 O45 P10 Yb5. From the CIF bond table, Yb1 (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Yb2 (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Yb3 (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Yb4 (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Yb5 (Yb) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 10 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.535-5.074 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 87.50-158.55°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C90H115N10O45P10Yb5.",
